{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique fusion of block-building strategy and high-octane space battles.</strong><br>In <i>Tenvader</i>, you don\u2019t just pilot a spaceship \u2014 you <strong>build it, block by block, in the middle of combat</strong>. Blast waves of alien invaders, collect stat blocks to upgrade your weapons, and survive against bosses that grow deadlier with each chaotic loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage blends <strong>fast-paced bullet-dodging</strong> with <strong>Tetris-style block stacking</strong>. Match the right blocks to boost damage, shields, and speed, or unlock powerful weapons to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in this demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the <strong>first 3 bosses</strong> in Loop 1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat block system</strong>: stack and absorb blocks to increase stats and unlock weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage rewards</strong>: choose blocks after each stage to shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special stage</strong>: collect random blocks quickly to power up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penalty system</strong>: fail to clear enemies in time and face harsher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic GUI: lobby, settings, demo ending.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959290?t=1756008655","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959290/7f5235ca4bf375e3a1b5e049efe72056ffa90c88/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756008655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959290/0767f7a7b9985870fa3387f9b32aff1a5b8834cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756008655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959290/0767f7a7b9985870